6 gap-8\"> <div class=\"scroll-reveal animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-bottom-4 duration-700\" style=\"animation-delay: 0ms\"> <h4 class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold text-steel uppercase tracking-[0.5px] mb-4\">About</h4> <ul class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"> <li> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"footer-link-underline text-sm text-steel hover:text-ink transition-colors py-1.5 inline-block\"> Our Story </a> </li><li> <a href=\"/about#mission\" class=\"footer-link-underline text-sm text-steel hover:text-ink transition-colors py-1.5 inline-block\"> Mission &amp; Vision </a> </li><li> <a href=\"/team\" class=\"footer-link-underline text-sm text-steel hover:text-ink transition-colors py-1.5 inline-block\"> Our Team </a> </li><li> <a href=\"/about#chapters\" class=\"footer-link-underline text-sm text-steel hover:text-ink transition-colors py-1.5 inline-block\"> Our Chapters </a> </li><li> <a href=\"/faq\" class=\"footer-link-underline text-sm text-steel hover:text-ink transition-colors py-1.5 inline-block\"> FAQ </a> </li> </ul> </div> <div class=\"scroll-reveal animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-bottom-4 duration-700\" style=\"animation-delay: 100ms\"> <h4 class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold text-steel uppercase tracking-[0.5px] mb-4\">Causes</h4> <ul class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"> <li> <a href=\"/causes\" class=\"footer-link-underline text-sm text-steel hover:text-ink transition-colors py-1.5 inline-block\"> All Causes </a> </li><li> <a href=\"/causes/peace-education\" class=\"footer-link-underline text-sm text-steel hover:text-ink transition-colors py-1.5 inline-block\"> Peace Education </a> </li><li> <a href=\"/causes/healthcare-outreach\" class=\"footer-link-underline text-sm text-steel hover:text-ink transition-colors py-1.5 inline-block\"> Healthcare </a> </li><li> <a href=\"/causes/clean-water-access\" class=\"footer-link-underline text-sm text-steel hover:text-ink transition-colors py-1.5 inline-block\"> Clean Water </a> </li><li> <a href=\"/causes/youth-empowerment-initiative